{"id":"yate","lemma":"yate","pos":"noun","rank":4245,"glosses":["yacht"],"ipa":"/ˈʝate/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"yates"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cb/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-yate.wav","examples":[{"text":"Yo soy dueño de un yate.","en":"I own a yacht.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440367","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"owner"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tom tiene un yate privado.","en":"Tom has a private yacht.","words":[null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"private, privy"}]},{"text":"Tenemos un yate, dos helicópteros y un hidroavión.","en":"We have a yacht, two helicopters, and a seaplane.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"dung, excrement"},{"g":"helicopter","l":"helicóptero"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Me gustaría ser lo suficientemente rico como para comprar un yate.","en":"I wish that I were rich enough to buy a yacht.","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"sufficiently"},{"g":"rich"},null,null,{"g":"to buy"},{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[6,8,"to"]]},{"text":"Tomás ha estado ahorrando para comprarse un yate.","en":"Tom has been saving up to buy a yacht.","words":[{"g":"to take","l":"tomar"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"country, land"},{"g":"to save","l":"ahorrar"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"to buy","l":"comprar"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}